From 256ad42dc2adc837b6265fd3c3fae643214a4234 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonas Salo <salomannen1234@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 17:46:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] graphics: add Oplus blur RenderEffect hooks and Gainmap
 HDR accessors

The OEM camera/gallery stack and oplus-fwk's material blur helpers call
two framework surfaces AOSP does not expose:

- RenderEffect: Oplus blur effect creation hooks, consumed by
  OplusRenderEffect and OplusViewBackgroundRenderEffect.
- Gainmap: Oplus HDR scale accessors used by the Image HDR path.

Squashed by topic from the m4 refinement series; tree-identical to that
series, history consolidated only.

(cherry picked from commit 34de67f3c6dbc74d451f50ccc47b433173bbc183)
---
